---
export interface Props {
  lang: "en" | "es";
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;

const content = {
  en: {
    title: "Testimonials",
    eyebrow: "Real students. Real results.",
  },
  es: {
    title: "Testimonios",
    eyebrow: "Estudiantes reales. Resultados reales.",
  },
};

const testimonials = [
  {
    quote:
      "Volví a sentir el impulso de construir algo propio. Me inscribí sin estar segura del momento. Este taller me hizo darme cuenta — el momento siempre es ahora. Los módulos de mindfulness y motivación combinan lo emocional con lo práctico de una manera que muy pocas comunidades logran.",
    name: "Cely S.",
    location: "Argentina",
    initials: "CS",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "I came in with many doubts. I left with clarity, real tools, and a community that genuinely pushes you forward. This community doesn't just teach you. It opens the doors to a digital future you thought was far away.",
    name: "Tanya V.",
    location: "USA",
    initials: "TV",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "The community I needed to finally launch. Within weeks I built my website, set up my e-commerce store, and started creating Canva content that actually converts. The real win? Feeling supported at every step.",
    name: "Marina P.",
    location: "USA",
    initials: "MP",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "Ana enseña con una pasión y dedicación que rara vez se ve. Abre puertas reales al emprendimiento y a un futuro lleno de oportunidades. Desde que me uní a esta comunidad, por fin siento que tengo el apoyo y las herramientas para construir algo propio.",
    name: "Fiorella R.",
    location: "Chile",
    initials: "FR",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "I arrived energetic and left with a clear roadmap. I learned to build my website, sell digital products, and use AI to work ten times faster. I didn't expect to find so much in one place: business strategy, tech skills and a genuine community.",
    name: "Valentina M.",
    location: "Venezuela",
    initials: "VM",
  },
  {
    quote:
      'Hola a todos los miembros de esta maravillosa comunidad. Actualmente estoy leyendo el libro "Éxito silencioso" y me está fascinando. Estoy aprendiendo muchos conceptos nuevos, y esta Academia me ayuda a aplicarlos en la práctica.',
    name: "Rosario D.",
    location: "Argentina",
    initials: "RD",
  },
];

const t = content[lang];
---

<section
  id="testimonials"
  class="bg-background text-primary py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-primary/10 overflow-hidden"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div
        class="font-outfit flex justify-center items-center gap-2 text-cta text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-4"
      >
        <span>✦</span>
        {t.eyebrow}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-primary">
        {t.title}
      </h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Carousel full-bleed -->
  <div class="carousel-mask">
    <div class="carousel-track">
      {
        [...testimonials, ...testimonials].map((item) => (
          <div class="carousel-card bg-card border border-primary/10 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col">
            <div class="flex gap-1 text-cta text-base mb-4">
              {Array(5)
                .fill(null)
                .map(() => (
                  <span>★</span>
                ))}
            </div>

            <p class="font-outfit text-base text-dark/80 leading-relaxed flex-1">
              "{item.quote}"
            </p>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-primary/10 pt-5 mt-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-card border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cta font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">
                {item.initials}
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-primary">
                  {item.name}
                </p>
                <p class="font-outfit text-xs text-dark/80">{item.location}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
